# The build context is the repository root (see compose.yml: context: .), so
# this file lives here — Docker looks for .dockerignore at the context root,
# not next to the Dockerfile. The context only needs go.mod and go.sum; the
# source is bind-mounted at runtime, not copied into the image. Everything
# else is excluded so the context stays small and an unrelated edit does not
# invalidate a layer.

*

!go.mod
!go.sum
